A diagram fence's info string names its side, before or after. A fence with a
line outside the participants, actors and messages attn draws is kept with
drawn false and one problem naming the first such line. Participants a message
names first are declared in order of use.
-- base/a.go --
package a

func A() {}

func B() {}
-- head/a.go --
package a

func A() { B() }

func B() { println() }
-- review.md --
---
frame: map
---
# Flow

```mermaid before
sequenceDiagram
  actor u as User
  u->>a: calls A
  %% stop: a.go:3-3
```

```mermaid after
sequenceDiagram
  participant a as A
  u-)a: calls A
  a-->>+b: calls B
  %% stop: a.go:3-3
  b--xa: fails
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  a->>b: calls B
  loop every poll
    b->>b: refresh
  end
  Note over a: never drawn
```

## A calls B

### a.go:3-3

### a.go:5-5
